!
! How many of a candidate's senses are among a headword's, in Trebago
! (wordhoard_rules.h WH4): the count of pairs with sense(i) = head(j),
! each list holding a synset number once. A synset number is
! 1..999999999 (OEWN's offset times 10 plus its part of speech); ok is 1
! when every number on both sides is, else 0, and the count is divided by
! it: anything else is a division by zero, refused, where shared.kron
! counts it: held. Exact; shared.kron says the same.
trebago shared_senses
  in  head(m), sense(n)
  out shared
  var ok
  ok = 1 - min(1, sum(i, min(1, max(0, 1 - sense(i))) + min(1, max(0, sense(i) - 999999999))) &
       + sum(j, min(1, max(0, 1 - head(j))) + min(1, max(0, head(j) - 999999999))))
  shared = sum(i, sum(j, 1 - min(1, abs(sense(i) - head(j))))) / ok
end
